Thus we need to establish clearance. There are several establish_clearance actions: nominal, origin_loaded, destination_loaded, full_load. They require candidate_loading_verified, candidate_compliance_certificate_linked, candidate_loading_container_linked, loading_container_leg_linked, plus some leg loaded conditions.

