Let's outline full plan:

Phase A: Prepare origin_availability_alpha
1. create_candidate origin_availability_alpha
2. allocate_vehicle_unit origin_availability_alpha vehicle_unit_alpha
3. attach_task_profile origin_availability_alpha route_task_profile_alpha
4. confirm_candidate_preparedness origin_availability_alpha route_task_profile_alpha
5. assign_operator_resource origin_availability_alpha driver_operator_alpha
6. activate_origin_node origin_availability_alpha origin_node_alpha route_task_profile_alpha
7. lock_origin_availability origin_availability_alpha origin_node_alpha driver_operator_alpha
8. detach_task_profile origin_availability_alpha route_task_profile_alpha   (free profile)
9. release_operator_resource origin_availability_alpha driver_operator_alpha   (free operator)

Phase B: Prepare destination_availability_alpha
10. create_candidate destination_availability_alpha
11. allocate_vehicle_unit destination_availability_alpha vehicle_unit_beta
12. attach_task_profile destination_availability_alpha route_task_profile_alpha
13. confirm_candidate_preparedness destination_availability_alpha route_task_profile_alpha
14. assign_operator_resource destination_availability_alpha driver_operator_alpha
15. activate_destination_node destination_availability_alpha destination_node_alpha route_task_profile_alpha
16. lock_destination_availability destination_availability_alpha destination_node_alpha driver_operator_alpha
17. detach_task_profile destination_availability_alpha route_task_profile_alpha
18. release_operator_resource destination_availability_alpha driver_operator_alpha

Now both origin and destination are locked and confirmed, nodes ready, etc. Profiles detached, operator free.

Phase C: Prepare transport leg
19. assemble_transport_leg origin_availability_alpha destination_availability_alpha origin_node_alpha destination_node_alpha transport_leg_alpha
   (Preconditions: origin_locked, dest_locked, node linked, nodes ready, avail confirmed, transport_leg_available)
   Effects: transport_leg_assembled, leg linked, transport_leg_available false.

20. authorize_transport_leg_loading transport_leg_alpha origin_availability_alpha route_task_profile_alpha
   Need origin_availability_locked (true), candidate_task_profile_linked origin_availability_alpha route_task_profile_alpha (but we detached earlier!). So we need to reattach profile to origin before this step.

Thus we need to reattach profile to origin after phase B, before authorization.

Thus after step 18, we attach profile to origin again:

19'. attach_task_profile origin_availability_alpha route_task_profile_alpha   (now profile attached to origin)

20. authorize_transport_leg_loading transport_leg_alpha origin_availability_alpha route_task_profile_alpha

Now we have transport_leg_assembled and loading authorized.

Phase D: Load container onto leg (for shift_candidate_alpha)
We need loading_container_alpha available (still true). candidate_transport_leg_linked shift_candidate_alpha transport_leg_alpha (true from init). candidate_loading_container_linked shift_candidate_alpha loading_container_alpha (true). loading_container_available loading_container_alpha (true). transport_leg_assembled true, transport_leg_loading_authorized true.

21. load_container_onto_leg shift_candidate_alpha loading_container_alpha transport_leg_alpha

Effects: loading_container_loaded loading_container_alpha true, loading_container_leg_linked loading_container_alpha transport_leg_alpha true, loading_container_available loading_container_alpha false.

Phase E: Prepare shift_candidate_alpha (schedule_candidate)
We need to create it, allocate vehicle, attach profile, confirm prepared, assign operator and skill certificate, etc.

But note we already have shift_candidate_alpha as an object; not created yet. So:

22. create_candidate shift_candidate_alpha
23. allocate_vehicle_unit shift_candidate_alpha vehicle_unit_gamma   (remaining vehicle)
24. attach_task_profile shift_candidate_alpha route_task_profile_alpha   (need profile; currently attached to origin, we need to detach from origin first)

Thus before attaching to shift_candidate_alpha, we detach profile from origin:

23'. detach_task_profile origin_availability_alpha route_task_profile_alpha   (free profile)

24. attach_task_profile shift_candidate_alpha route_task_profile_alpha

25. confirm_candidate_preparedness shift_candidate_alpha route_task_profile_alpha
26. assign_operator_resource shift_candidate_alpha driver_operator_alpha   (need operator free; we released after dest)
27. assign_skill_certificate shift_candidate_alpha skill_certificate_alpha   (need skill cert available)

Now we have shift_candidate_alpha prepared, operator linked, skill cert linked.

We also need candidate_loading_container_linked (already true from init), loading_container_loaded and loading_container_leg_linked (true from step 21). candidate_task_profile_linked true.

Now we need to stage shift_candidate_alpha: stage_schedule_candidate requires candidate_prepared, candidate_loading_container_linked, loading_container_loaded, loading_container_leg_linked, candidate_task_profile_linked, not origin_leg_loaded, not candidate_staged_for_loading.

We have origin_leg_loaded false (since we used assemble_transport_leg not loaded). Good.

Thus:

28. stage_schedule_candidate shift_candidate_alpha loading_container_alpha transport_leg_alpha route_task_profile_alpha

Effect: candidate_staged_for_loading shift_candidate_alpha true.

Now verify loading profile nominal: verify_loading_profile_nominal shift_candidate_alpha skill_certificate_alpha driver_operator_alpha loading_container_alpha transport_leg_alpha

Preconditions: candidate_staged_for_loading (true), candidate_skill_certificate_linked (true), candidate_operator_linked (true), candidate_loading_container_linked (true), loading_container_leg_linked (true), not destination_leg_loaded (true), not candidate_loading_verified (true).

