We have candidate_clearance_established true, route_sequence_context_set true, need service_window linked, origin_availability_linked, destination_availability_linked (we have from init), origin_availability_confirmed true (from lock), destination_availability_confirmed true, candidate_task_profile_linked true (we attached profile to shift_candidate_alpha). So we need to link service_window to shift_candidate_alpha.

We have service_window_alpha and beta available. Choose one.

