Preconditions: dispatch_ready shift_candidate_alpha (now true), candidate_task_profile_linked shift_candidate_alpha route_task_profile_alpha (true), dispatch_slot_available dispatch_slot_alpha (true), not dispatch_allocated shift_candidate_alpha (true).

