Preconditions: dispatch_allocated shift_candidate_alpha true, candidate_vehicle_linked shift_candidate_alpha vehicle_unit_gamma (we allocated vehicle_unit_gamma earlier, and effect of allocate_vehicle_unit set candidate_vehicle_linked), candidate_dispatch_slot_linked shift_candidate_alpha dispatch_slot_alpha (true), not dispatched shift_candidate_alpha (true). Effect: dispatched shift_candidate_alpha true, vehicle_available vehicle_unit_gamma true, dispatch_slot_available dispatch_slot_alpha true.

